                               Server icons
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------


[LBBS]                 :  You can switch between the full server window
                          showing all icons and buttons, or the short
                          version that shows the nodes only.

[X]                    :  Beside the wide "Logicbbs functions" icon,
                          you can see a X icon, press this and you will
                          see a bar popping up in the bottom of the server.
                          This bar shows:
                           UL: aaaaaaaaaa(bbbb) : a= bytes uploaded today
                                                  b= files ==============

                           DL: aaaaaaaaaa(bbbb) : a= bytes downloaded today
                                                  b= files ================

                           CALLS: aaaaaaa       : a= calls received since
                                                     system was started
                                                     ( this is calls since
                                                       your first startup)

                           -----: aaaaaaa       : a= calls today for all nodes

                           TIMEUSED:  aaa:aa    : a= hour:minutes used on
                                                     the system today.

[LAST 5 CALLERS]       :  below the icon you can see the last 5 users
                          on the system.
                          You can see what node user called, and if he paged
                          sysop.
                          If you press the "LAST 5 CALLERS" bar, you will
                          switch to "LAST 5 UPLOADS"

[LAST 5 UPLOADS]       :  Below the icon you can see the last 5 uploads
                          to the system.
                          press the "LAST 5 UPLOADS", and you will switch
                          to "LAST 5 DOWNLOADS"

[LAST 5 DOWNLOADS]     :  Below the icon you can see the last 5 downloads
                          from the system.

[NODE x]               :  This icon is the main selector for node actions.
                          the icon can do multiply functions.

                          1: It will activate node, if it is closed.
                          2: If node is already active, it will open the
                             node window, or put it up front, if it is
                             already opened.
                          3: Pressing one of the buttons below the
                             "Logicbbs functions" icon, followed by
                             pressing a [NODE x] icon, will activate
                             selected function on node x.

[Logicbbs functions]   :  Is a selector between action commands sent to a
                          node, and "Extended functions"

[Extended functions]   :  Is a set of definable icons which you may want
                          to use for own purposes.
                          The icons in "Extended functions" can be setup
                          in 2 ways.
                          function :

                          1: activator for a selected program.

                          2: activation of a program which needs a node
                             number after its name.
                             You press the icon and the node number to
                             activate this function.

                          the 2 different functions will be shown to you
                          in black and blue (Workbench colors).
                          black color icons are function 2, and
                          blue colored icons are using function 1.

                          definition of these icons are explained later in
                          the manual.

